<%- include('partials/head') %>
<main class="container admin-page" id="main"><%- include('partials/admin-nav') %>
<div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Unlock tasks</h2><p>Add the tasks you want. Each task has its own link, and the same type can be added more than once.</p></div></div>
<form class="form-panel" id="task-editor" method="post" action="/robloxploit-slimexdev/settings">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="tasks_json" id="tasks-json">
<%- include('partials/task-editor') %>
<p class="field-help">1–20 tasks. Choose Open link for other websites. These defaults apply to posts without their own tasks and completed in the order shown.</p>
<label for="wait_seconds">Wait time for link tasks (seconds)</label><input type="number" id="wait_seconds" name="wait_seconds" min="1" max="120" required value="<%= settings.wait_seconds %>">
<p class="field-help">Watch video tasks require 40 seconds of playback in the embedded YouTube player. Pausing the video, closing the unlock window or switching tabs pauses the watch timer. Use a direct video link with embedding enabled. Other tasks use the wait time above; subscriptions and other interactions are not verified.</p>
<button class="button" type="submit">Save tasks</button></form></main>
<script src="/assets/admin-tasks.js?v=1" defer></script><%- include('partials/footer') %>
